@page "/components/popover"

<PageTitle>Popover — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Popover</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The <code>[popover]</code> API — the top layer, light dismiss and Escape, none of it written
    here. It can be measured against something other than its trigger, which is what
    <code>PopoverAnchor</code> is for.
</p>

