<Example Source="PopoverAlign.razor"><PopoverAlign /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">With Form</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The top layer is a paint concern, not a DOM one: the panel is still inside the
    <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> it is written in, and still submits with it.
</p>
<Example Source="PopoverWithForm.razor"><PopoverWithForm /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Anchor</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Measured against the whole row rather than against the little button, so the panel lines up
    with the field a reader is actually looking at.
</p>
<Example Source="CompositionExample.razor"><CompositionExample /></Example>

